    "# WgSense 内置代理内核的默认配置（首次启动自动生成，可替换为自己的配置）\n# 只监听本机端口，不开 TUN、不接管 DNS、不改系统代理。\nmixed-port: 7895\nbind-address: 127.0.0.1\nallow-lan: false\nmode: rule\nlog-level: warning\ngeo-auto-update: false\nprofile:\n  store-selected: true\nproxies: []\nrules:\n  - MATCH,DIRECT" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "comment" : "守护进程日志 / 接口提示（Go 源码句式）",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "# Default config for WgSense's built-in proxy core (generated on first launch; replace with your own)\n# Listens locally only; no TUN, DNS takeover, or system proxy changes.\nmixed-port: 7895\nbind-address: 127.0.0.1\nallow-lan: false\nmode: rule\nlog-level: warning\ngeo-auto-update: false\nprofile:\n  store-selected: true\nproxies: []\nrules:\n  - MATCH,DIRECT"
          }
